  m_Text: '<b>The ring of flames</b>

    The cosmic cycle and the universe.


    <b>The drum</b>

    The rhythm of creation.


    <b>The flame</b>

    Destruction and transformation.


    <b>The raised foot</b>

    Liberation.


    <b>The dance</b>

    The dynamic balance of the cosmos.'
